<!-- QRIS -->
<section class="page" id="page-qris"><div class="page-top"><div><div class="page-label">ACCEPT PAYMENTS</div><h1 class="page-title">QRIS Studio<span class="lime">.</span></h1><p class="page-intro">Generate QRIS nominal tetap dari QRIS statis merchant yang valid.</p></div><span class="chip pending">● TERHUBUNG SETELAH LOGIN</span></div><div class="split"><div class="card reveal"><div class="card-head"><div><h3 class="card-title">Create new payment</h3><p class="card-sub">Gunakan QRIS statis milik merchant Anda.</p></div><span class="chip">01 / 02</span></div><form id="qrisForm"><div class="field-group"><label class="control-label" for="qrisMerchant">Merchant account</label><select class="control" id="qrisMerchant"><option value="live">Merchant dari akun GoPay yang terhubung</option></select></div><div class="field-group"><label class="control-label" for="qrisAmount">Jumlah pembayaran (IDR)</label><input class="control" id="qrisAmount" max="100000000" min="1000" placeholder="Contoh: 125000" required="" step="1000" type="number"/><div class="hint">Masukkan nominal valid dalam rupiah. QRIS yang dihasilkan menggunakan API proyek.</div></div><div class="field-group"><label class="control-label" for="qrisStaticInput">QRIS statis merchant</label><textarea class="control live-qr-input" id="qrisStaticInput" placeholder="Tempel payload QRIS statis dari merchant Anda" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="inline-actions" style="margin-top:9px"><label class="btn btn-sm" for="qrisUploadFile">Unggah gambar QRIS <input accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" hidden="" id="qrisUploadFile" type="file"/></label><button class="btn btn-sm" id="saveStaticQr" type="button">Simpan QRIS statis</button><button class="btn btn-sm" id="deleteStaticQr" type="button">Hapus</button></div><div class="hint" id="staticQrSaveState">Belum ada QRIS statis tersimpan.</div></div><div class="warning">QRIS dihasilkan dari data merchant Anda. Pastikan payload QRIS statis benar sebelum menggunakannya untuk pembayaran.</div><button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:22px" type="submit">Generate QRIS</button></form></div><div class="card reveal delay1"><div class="card-head"><div><h3 class="card-title">Payment preview</h3><p class="card-sub">Live local preview · no real transaction</p></div><span class="chip">02 / 02</span></div><div class="qris-preview"><div class="qris-placeholder" id="qrisPlaceholder"><div class="placeholder-circle"><svg class="icon large" style="width:44px;height:44px"><use href="#i-qris"></use></svg></div><h3>Siap membuat QRIS</h3><p>Isi nominal dan QRIS statis, lalu generate kode pembayaran.</p></div><div class="qr-content" id="qrContent"><div class="eyebrow">MERCHANT QRIS · LIVE OUTPUT</div><img alt="Hasil QRIS yang dibuat server" class="live-image" id="liveQrImage"/><div class="qr-warning">Periksa kecocokan transaksi melalui mutasi merchant.</div><h3 id="qrTotal" style="font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:0">Rp125.000</h3><div class="qr-code-id" id="qrReference">Belum dibuat</div><div class="qris-status" id="qrState">● QRIS dibuat · belum terverifikasi</div><div class="inline-actions" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:20px"><button class="btn btn-primary" id="simulatePaid" type="button">Cek status (indikatif)</button><button class="btn" id="resetQr" type="button">Reset tampilan</button></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<!-- TRANSACTIONS -->
<section class="page" id="page-transactions"><div class="page-top"><div><div class="page-label">PAYMENT HISTORY</div><h1 class="page-title">Transactions<span class="lime">.</span></h1><p class="page-intro">Mutasi QRIS yang dimuat dari endpoint merchant GoPay. Pencarian dan filter bekerja pada hasil yang tersedia.</p></div><div class="inline-actions"><button class="btn" id="exportTransactions"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-export"></use></svg> Export CSV</button><button class="btn btn-primary" data-route="qris">New QRIS <svg class="icon"><use href="#i-arrow"></use></svg></button></div></div><div class="metric-grid" style="margin-bottom:17px"><div class="metric reveal" style="min-height:120px"><div class="eyebrow">Nominal dimuat</div><div class="metric-value" id="txMetric0">—</div><div class="metric-foot">Hasil yang dimuat</div></div><div class="metric reveal delay1" style="min-height:120px"><div class="eyebrow">Jurnal selesai</div><div class="metric-value" id="txMetric1">—</div><div class="metric-foot pos">Pembayaran dikonfirmasi</div></div><div class="metric reveal delay2" style="min-height:120px"><div class="eyebrow">Jurnal pending</div><div class="metric-value" id="txMetric2">—</div><div class="metric-foot">Menunggu pembayaran</div></div><div class="metric reveal delay3" style="min-height:120px"><div class="eyebrow">Jurnal gagal</div><div class="metric-value" id="txMetric3">—</div><div class="metric-foot">Tidak berhasil</div></div></div><div class="card reveal"><div class="table-toolbar"><div class="search-field"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-search"></use></svg><input aria-label="Cari transaksi" id="txSearch" placeholder="Cari ID, pelanggan, nominal..." type="search"/></div><div class="inline-actions"><select aria-label="Filter status" class="select" id="txFilter"><option value="ALL">Semua status</option><option value="PAID">Paid</option><option value="PENDING">Pending</option><option value="FAILED">Failed</option></select><select aria-label="Urutkan transaksi" class="select" id="txSort"><option value="latest">Terbaru</option><option value="amount">Nominal terbesar</option></select></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Transaction ID</th><th>Customer</th><th>Date &amp; time</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="txBody"></tbody></table></div><div class="fine" id="txCount" style="padding-top:16px">Belum ada data.</div></div></section>
